(5440812, 782541, 101256, '<td valign="top">Technically a stick pin, but who cares...Simple and elegant - this should be a solid contender for a ribbon. One minor issue is the small white light bloom on the pin head, but that is so picky, it''s ridiculous.  Well done.</td>', 'Technically a stick pin, but who cares...Simple and elegant - this should be a solid contender for a ribbon. One minor issue is the small white light bloom on the pin head, but that is so picky, it''s ridiculous.  Well done.', '2009-04-16 18:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440814, 782625, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is simply whimsical, well designed and executed in fine fashion. Colorful with a very clever look at the subject matter. The fact that they are push pins and not tacks is irrelevant. :&gt;) A solid ribbon contender.</td>', 'This is simply whimsical, well designed and executed in fine fashion. Colorful with a very clever look at the subject matter. The fact that they are push pins and not tacks is irrelevant. :>) A solid ribbon contender.', '2009-04-16 18:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440815, 782695, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simply the best and most clever image so far - well thought out and perfectly executed. No issues with this image, it should be a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Simply the best and most clever image so far - well thought out and perfectly executed. No issues with this image, it should be a ribbon winner.', '2009-04-16 18:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440817, 782642, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, a great image just jumps out and screams LOOK AT ME!! This is one of those images. Very clever concept. A few minor flaws, but who cares - a great idea and that counts for a lot. Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes, a great image just jumps out and screams LOOK AT ME!! This is one of those images. Very clever concept. A few minor flaws, but who cares - a great idea and that counts for a lot. Well done.', '2009-04-16 18:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440820, 782595, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another clever entry into the challenge and one that deserves to be highly rated if only for it''s cleverness and whimsy. Excellant execution with no major or minor flaws - simply great.  Well done.</td>', 'Another clever entry into the challenge and one that deserves to be highly rated if only for it''s cleverness and whimsy. Excellant execution with no major or minor flaws - simply great.  Well done.', '2009-04-16 18:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440829, 782597, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and perfectly executed. A sure bet to win a ribbon.</td>', 'Simple, elegant and perfectly executed. A sure bet to win a ribbon.', '2009-04-16 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440830, 782645, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another terrific idea perfectly executed. Very clever and well thought out. Great composition and a sure contender for a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'Another terrific idea perfectly executed. Very clever and well thought out. Great composition and a sure contender for a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-04-16 19:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440833, 782591, 101256, '<td valign="top">Rated highly if only because of it''s wonder sense of whimsy and clever use of materials at hand. A top ten contender if not a ribbon winner if only because of it''s senes of humor. An image sometimes needs not to be perfect, but present an idea - this is both rolled in one. A few minor issues that make it less than perfect, but this should be a top ten if not a ribbon contender.</td>', 'Rated highly if only because of it''s wonder sense of whimsy and clever use of materials at hand. A top ten contender if not a ribbon winner if only because of it''s senes of humor. An image sometimes needs not to be perfect, but present an idea - this is both rolled in one. A few minor issues that make it less than perfect, but this should be a top ten if not a ribbon contender.', '2009-04-16 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440834, 782724, 59276, '<td valign="top">what no hat trick? lol</td>', 'what no hat trick? lol', '2009-04-16 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440839, 782684, 101256, '<td valign="top">This reviewer initially gave this a nine, but on commenting review, rerated it a ten for several reasons. First, there are few white blooms that are a little distracting and could have been handled better. Having said that, from a concept standpoint along with the vibrant color and very cleverly executed staging, it is a simply brilliant concept even if it''s less than perfectly executed. A top ten winner and a potential blue ribbon contender.</td>', 'This reviewer initially gave this a nine, but on commenting review, rerated it a ten for several reasons. First, there are few white blooms that are a little distracting and could have been handled better. Having said that, from a concept standpoint along with the vibrant color and very cleverly executed staging, it is a simply brilliant concept even if it''s less than perfectly executed. A top ten winner and a potential blue ribbon contender.', '2009-04-16 19:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440843, 782715, 101256, '<td valign="top">Whimsical, brilliantly executed and not major or minor flaws to speak of. The background could have been less bright, but it does work as it is. This reviewer initially rated it a nine, but when returning to comment, decided to rerate it a ten and hopefully that will help it win the ribbon it deserves. Well done.</td>', 'Whimsical, brilliantly executed and not major or minor flaws to speak of. The background could have been less bright, but it does work as it is. This reviewer initially rated it a nine, but when returning to comment, decided to rerate it a ten and hopefully that will help it win the ribbon it deserves. Well done.', '2009-04-16 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440847, 782616, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing look at everyday objects and money. A terrific presentaion with no major or minor flaws, this image works on several levels. Crisp, sharp and very clear. Originally rated a nine, this reviewer rerated it a ten if only because of it''s clever concept and perfect execution. Should be a ribbon contender and most certainly a top ten image. Well done.</td>', 'A very intriguing look at everyday objects and money. A terrific presentaion with no major or minor flaws, this image works on several levels. Crisp, sharp and very clear. Originally rated a nine, this reviewer rerated it a ten if only because of it''s clever concept and perfect execution. Should be a ribbon contender and most certainly a top ten image. Well done.', '2009-04-16 19:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440849, 782643, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another image originally rated a nine, this reviewer rerated it a ten on closer inspection. Originally, the image appeared to be less than acceptable from a technical standpoint, but further reflection and viewing suggested that the original impression was wrong and a correction in scoring needed. This should be a top ten image and a potential ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'Another image originally rated a nine, this reviewer rerated it a ten on closer inspection. Originally, the image appeared to be less than acceptable from a technical standpoint, but further reflection and viewing suggested that the original impression was wrong and a correction in scoring needed. This should be a top ten image and a potential ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-16 19:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440851, 782686, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect - simply perfect. Beautiful execution on a very clever idea. This reviewer originally rated this a nine because of the motion blur which originally gave an impression of imprecision, but after reviewing the image for comment, the author''s intent became clear and the image rerated. A ribbon contender and should be a top ten rated image. Well done.</td>', 'Perfect - simply perfect. Beautiful execution on a very clever idea. This reviewer originally rated this a nine because of the motion blur which originally gave an impression of imprecision, but after reviewing the image for comment, the author''s intent became clear and the image rerated. A ribbon contender and should be a top ten rated image. Well done.', '2009-04-16 19:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440853, 782543, 106010, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture! I like how there is a contrast between the red of the apple and the silvery color of the tacks. It makes the tacks look almost like crystal! :D The only thing I would have done differently was maybe have had a black background, but as it is, the gray works fine.</td>', 'I really like this picture! I like how there is a contrast between the red of the apple and the silvery color of the tacks. It makes the tacks look almost like crystal! :D The only thing I would have done differently was maybe have had a black background, but as it is, the gray works fine.', '2009-04-16 19:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440861, 782538, 101256, '<td valign="top">Originally, the offset gave the impression of too much black space, but upon review, this image works perfectly. Wonderful DOF control being just vague enough to provide a senes of depth, but providing detail and context. Originally rated a nine, it has been rerated a 10. Top ten contender and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'Originally, the offset gave the impression of too much black space, but upon review, this image works perfectly. Wonderful DOF control being just vague enough to provide a senes of depth, but providing detail and context. Originally rated a nine, it has been rerated a 10. Top ten contender and a potential ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-16 19:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440866, 782659, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple brilliant concept and perfectly executed capture. The image appears to be a touch oversharpened on initial review, but on comment review, this was a clear error on the part of the reviewer. Rerated a ten from a nine this image deserves to be a top ten if not a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Simple brilliant concept and perfectly executed capture. The image appears to be a touch oversharpened on initial review, but on comment review, this was a clear error on the part of the reviewer. Rerated a ten from a nine this image deserves to be a top ten if not a ribbon winner.', '2009-04-16 19:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440870, 782580, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nicely executed image with good central focus and a clever viewpoint. No major flaws, but it would appear that it lacks something that affects it''s impact on the viewer from an interest standpoint. A techcnical success just shy of being an artistic success.</td>', 'A nicely executed image with good central focus and a clever viewpoint. No major flaws, but it would appear that it lacks something that affects it''s impact on the viewer from an interest standpoint. A techcnical success just shy of being an artistic success.', '2009-04-16 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440871, 782478, 105977, '<td valign="top">do not care for the dof</td>', 'do not care for the dof', '2009-04-16 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440872, 782473, 101256, '<td valign="top">The initial impression is positive, but it might have helped to have reduced the white bloom on the right a little and perhaps used a little more DOF control with a closer look at the stick pin - there are several ways this could have been improved. A great concept, just shy of perfect technical and artistic execution.</td>', 'The initial impression is positive, but it might have helped to have reduced the white bloom on the right a little and perhaps used a little more DOF control with a closer look at the stick pin - there are several ways this could have been improved. A great concept, just shy of perfect technical and artistic execution.', '2009-04-16 19:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440873, 782663, 101256, '<td valign="top">With a little less space a the top, this would have rated a 10. From a technical standpoint it''s an artistic success, but is just shy of being a perfect image because of it''s height. Should be a potential top ten and a possible ribbon winner.</td>', 'With a little less space a the top, this would have rated a 10. From a technical standpoint it''s an artistic success, but is just shy of being a perfect image because of it''s height. Should be a potential top ten and a possible ribbon winner.', '2009-04-16 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440878, 782717, 101256, '<td valign="top">The initial impression on the rating pass through was that while a technical success, the image was lacking some impact. On review, this image demans a rerating from an 8 to a 10. It works on many levels, but the initial impression is a little lacking. Perhaps a different choice of backgrounds or a textured background would have helped the original impression. Hopefully, a ribbon winner and/or a top ten ranking.</td>', 'The initial impression on the rating pass through was that while a technical success, the image was lacking some impact. On review, this image demans a rerating from an 8 to a 10. It works on many levels, but the initial impression is a little lacking. Perhaps a different choice of backgrounds or a textured background would have helped the original impression. Hopefully, a ribbon winner and/or a top ten ranking.', '2009-04-16 19:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440880, 782531, 101256, '<td valign="top">An artistic success, it falls shy of being a technical success because of the white blooms which ruin the overall impact. A little less lighting or exposure as exists on the right hand reflection of the tack shaft would have been a huge plus. As it is it should rate high, perhaps even a top ten. Well done.</td>', 'An artistic success, it falls shy of being a technical success because of the white blooms which ruin the overall impact. A little less lighting or exposure as exists on the right hand reflection of the tack shaft would have been a huge plus. As it is it should rate high, perhaps even a top ten. Well done.', '2009-04-16 19:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440883, 782558, 101256, '<td valign="top">The mask overpowers the image and leaves the viewer with a negataive impression before the stick pins are even noticed. An artistic selection that needed some more thought before shooting the image. From a technical standpoint, it''s very good. The author''s intent is clear, it''s just not perfectly executed.</td>', 'The mask overpowers the image and leaves the viewer with a negataive impression before the stick pins are even noticed. An artistic selection that needed some more thought before shooting the image. From a technical standpoint, it''s very good. The author''s intent is clear, it''s just not perfectly executed.', '2009-04-16 19:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440884, 782613, 101256, '<td valign="top">An artistic success, it lacks just a little in technical execution because of the lighting and slight DOF vagueness around the edges of the image. Certainly a litte more light and a little different angle would have made this a contender for a top prize.</td>', 'An artistic success, it lacks just a little in technical execution because of the lighting and slight DOF vagueness around the edges of the image. Certainly a litte more light and a little different angle would have made this a contender for a top prize.', '2009-04-16 19:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440886, 782705, 101256, '<td valign="top">Initial impression: From an artistic standpoint, this works on several levels. From a technical standpoint, it works on several levels. Unfortunately, the combination of the two fall well short of being perfect. However, on commenting, a different impression is conveyed which puts the original rating into question. This is very good - the angle enhances the image and while the water could use a little more active and detailed, the overall effect is positive. Originally rated an eight, it is rerated to a 9.</td>', 'Initial impression: From an artistic standpoint, this works on several levels. From a technical standpoint, it works on several levels. Unfortunately, the combination of the two fall well short of being perfect. However, on commenting, a different impression is conveyed which puts the original rating into question. This is very good - the angle enhances the image and while the water could use a little more active and detailed, the overall effect is positive. Originally rated an eight, it is rerated to a 9.', '2009-04-16 19:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440889, 782577, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author''s intent is clear, but it is a very busy image and that amount of detail is distracting in this setting. Fewer upholstery tacks would have helped this image tremendously and would have brought it to a whole different level.</td>', 'The author''s intent is clear, but it is a very busy image and that amount of detail is distracting in this setting. Fewer upholstery tacks would have helped this image tremendously and would have brought it to a whole different level.', '2009-04-16 19:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440892, 782671, 94235, '<td valign="top">A great effort and well done although I''m thinking Clinton would have been better suited in a tacky portrait of one of our leaders!  ;-)</td>', 'A great effort and well done although I''m thinking Clinton would have been better suited in a tacky portrait of one of our leaders!  ;-)', '2009-04-16 20:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440894, 782462, 101256, '<td valign="top">While a terrific concept and well imagined, the overly white needles detract from the image by not having any sort of detail. From an artistic standpoint, it works very well, as a technical success, it''s lacking by that one simple over exposure.</td>', 'While a terrific concept and well imagined, the overly white needles detract from the image by not having any sort of detail. From an artistic standpoint, it works very well, as a technical success, it''s lacking by that one simple over exposure.', '2009-04-16 20:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440896, 782638, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good macro. May have boosted the color a little for greater impact.</td>', 'Good macro. May have boosted the color a little for greater impact.', '2009-04-16 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5440898, 782634, 101256, '<td valign="top">Initially rated an eight, rerated to a nine. The green-on-green is a little distracting and a different color for either the model or the stick pin, but this is both a artistic and technical success. A little more focus would have helped it''s overall impact. Very well done.</td>', 'Initially rated an eight, rerated to a nine. The green-on-green is a little distracting and a different color for either the model or the stick pin, but this is both a artistic and technical success. A little more focus would have helped it''s overall impact. Very well done.', '2009-04-16 20:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440899, 782609, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good clear detail in the tacks. Found it took a while to define the teddy.</td>', 'Good clear detail in the tacks. Found it took a while to define the teddy.', '2009-04-16 20:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440900, 782613, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, colorful and well framed. Good job.</td>', 'Nice set up, colorful and well framed. Good job.', '2009-04-16 20:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440901, 782501, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever and a very good capture, it lacks impact. The whole idea is good, the image just looks flat and uninteresting which affects it''s rating as an artistic success. A little more contrast with either color or even a grayscale or black and white conversion might have helped this tremendously.</td>', 'Clever and a very good capture, it lacks impact. The whole idea is good, the image just looks flat and uninteresting which affects it''s rating as an artistic success. A little more contrast with either color or even a grayscale or black and white conversion might have helped this tremendously.', '2009-04-16 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440902, 782642, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The one on the left looks like it could get a full time gig on Sesame Street!</td>', 'Good concept. The one on the left looks like it could get a full time gig on Sesame Street!', '2009-04-16 20:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440904, 782691, 101256, '<td valign="top">This reviewer''s initial impression was that this was rated an eight, but returning to comment, this opinion was clearly in error and was rerated to a 10. Well thought out with a few minor flaws not worth mentioning, this has been rerated to a 10 and deservedly so. Both an artistic and technical success - very clever and interesting.</td>', 'This reviewer''s initial impression was that this was rated an eight, but returning to comment, this opinion was clearly in error and was rerated to a 10. Well thought out with a few minor flaws not worth mentioning, this has been rerated to a 10 and deservedly so. Both an artistic and technical success - very clever and interesting.', '2009-04-16 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440905, 782599, 94235, '<td valign="top">Stop reminding me. Nice shot and well framed.</td>', 'Stop reminding me. Nice shot and well framed.', '2009-04-16 20:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440906, 782615, 94235, '<td valign="top">Like the soft tones here and the contrast in the brightness of the tack. Nice colors and well framed also.</td>', 'Like the soft tones here and the contrast in the brightness of the tack. Nice colors and well framed also.', '2009-04-16 20:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440908, 782566, 94235, '<td valign="top">...and they look just that! I like the overall green tone. Well captured.</td>', '...and they look just that! I like the overall green tone. Well captured.', '2009-04-16 20:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440909, 782722, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks a little blurred overall. Nice lighting but maybe a greater DOF may have improved the shot.</td>', 'Looks a little blurred overall. Nice lighting but maybe a greater DOF may have improved the shot.', '2009-04-16 20:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440914, 782723, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The clarity of the droplets adds to a well captured project.</td>', 'Good concept. The clarity of the droplets adds to a well captured project.', '2009-04-16 20:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440917, 782627, 94235, '<td valign="top">Clever <strike>tack</strike>, I mean take on the challenge! Well done.</td>', 'Clever tack, I mean take on the challenge! Well done.', '2009-04-16 20:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440920, 782591, 94235, '<td valign="top">You should have listened! Only kidding...nice take on a difficult challenge.</td>', 'You should have listened! Only kidding...nice take on a difficult challenge.', '2009-04-16 20:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440921, 782673, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice mood and colors. Would have liked a little more light on the bubble to better define it but a good take all the same.</td>', 'Nice mood and colors. Would have liked a little more light on the bubble to better define it but a good take all the same.', '2009-04-16 20:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440922, 782622, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little more thought would have brought this to artistic and technical succcess.  As it stands, it lacks interest and the rather odd framing and DOF do not reflect on the title in a positive way. Perhaps a different approach would have been to go from sharp to vague in a more linear fashion bringing to mind a space elevator. The background could also have helped create some impact for this image.</td>', 'A little more thought would have brought this to artistic and technical succcess.  As it stands, it lacks interest and the rather odd framing and DOF do not reflect on the title in a positive way. Perhaps a different approach would have been to go from sharp to vague in a more linear fashion bringing to mind a space elevator. The background could also have helped create some impact for this image.', '2009-04-16 20:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440923, 782691, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great tones, background and reflection. Well done!</td>', 'Great tones, background and reflection. Well done!', '2009-04-16 20:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440924, 782537, 94235, '<td valign="top">Do they actually class them as tacks?</td>', 'Do they actually class them as tacks?', '2009-04-16 20:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440925, 782608, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea, but the lack of clear, sharp focus makes it less than successful both in an artistic and technical sense. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea, but the lack of clear, sharp focus makes it less than successful both in an artistic and technical sense. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440927, 782462, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well shot with good lighting and nicely finished with the frame. Only nit pick is that I would have cropped it tighter at the top.</td>', 'Well shot with good lighting and nicely finished with the frame. Only nit pick is that I would have cropped it tighter at the top.', '2009-04-16 20:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440928, 782627, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea, but the lack of clear, sharp focus on the challenge subject makes it less than successful both in an artistic and technical sense. The crittr''s face and expression take the viewer''s eye away from the subject matter which is the tack. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea, but the lack of clear, sharp focus on the challenge subject makes it less than successful both in an artistic and technical sense. The crittr''s face and expression take the viewer''s eye away from the subject matter which is the tack. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440932, 782685, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped tremenduosly. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped tremenduosly. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440933, 782713, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440934, 782635, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440935, 782724, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good angle and well shot. By the look of the board there are no dart players at your place!  ;-)</td>', 'Good angle and well shot. By the look of the board there are no dart players at your place!  ;-)', '2009-04-16 20:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440936, 782694, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good low angle and nice tones. I like the off center positioning too.</td>', 'Good low angle and nice tones. I like the off center positioning too.', '2009-04-16 20:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440938, 782570, 94235, '<td valign="top">Simply, a good concept and shot. Like the positioning and the frame. Well done</td>', 'Simply, a good concept and shot. Like the positioning and the frame. Well done', '2009-04-16 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440939, 782556, 101256, '<td valign="top">This reviewer originally had a negative reaction to this image as it appeared to over reach in terms of humor. Upon review when commenting, the author''s intent became much clearer. It''s a technical success and while the subject matter isn''t "artistic" in the normal sense, it does have a sense of humor and thus the rating have been upped to a 9 from a 7. Not a ribbon contender, it is worthy of a high placement because of it''s bold presentation.</td>', 'This reviewer originally had a negative reaction to this image as it appeared to over reach in terms of humor. Upon review when commenting, the author''s intent became much clearer. It''s a technical success and while the subject matter isn''t "artistic" in the normal sense, it does have a sense of humor and thus the rating have been upped to a 9 from a 7. Not a ribbon contender, it is worthy of a high placement because of it''s bold presentation.', '2009-04-16 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440940, 782565, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and a clever concept. You should be happy with the result. Well done.</td>', 'Great lighting and a clever concept. You should be happy with the result. Well done.', '2009-04-16 20:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440941, 782720, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, effectively lighted and a few minor issues that aren''t worth mentioning. Initially rated a 7, this reviewer didn''t fully appreciate the detail, color and effectiveness of the image. While a marginal issue, perhaps a little lighter touch with the background would have improved it''s initial impact tremendously. As it is, it should be a top ten image and a possible ribbon winner. Up rated to a nine.</td>', 'Simple, elegant, effectively lighted and a few minor issues that aren''t worth mentioning. Initially rated a 7, this reviewer didn''t fully appreciate the detail, color and effectiveness of the image. While a marginal issue, perhaps a little lighter touch with the background would have improved it''s initial impact tremendously. As it is, it should be a top ten image and a possible ribbon winner. Up rated to a nine.', '2009-04-16 20:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440942, 782570, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440943, 782599, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440944, 782647, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440945, 782626, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. The subject is less than interesting. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. The subject is less than interesting. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440946, 782592, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440947, 782692, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440948, 782574, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is good and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting and appears to be over sharpened. Perhaps a different background would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is good and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting and appears to be over sharpened. Perhaps a different background would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440949, 782573, 101256, '<td valign="top">Upon the initial rating pass, this reviewer lost sight of the humor behind this image and was distracted by the light on the helmet. While making the comment phase of rating the image, this reviewer recaptured his sense of humor and took a second look.  This image is both an artistic and technical success and is laugh-out-loud funny. Originally rated a 7, this has been rerated a 10 and it''s well worth that upgrade. If the there is any justice in the world, this image should be a ribbon winner. Well done - seriously, well done.</td>', 'Upon the initial rating pass, this reviewer lost sight of the humor behind this image and was distracted by the light on the helmet. While making the comment phase of rating the image, this reviewer recaptured his sense of humor and took a second look.  This image is both an artistic and technical success and is laugh-out-loud funny. Originally rated a 7, this has been rerated a 10 and it''s well worth that upgrade. If the there is any justice in the world, this image should be a ribbon winner. Well done - seriously, well done.', '2009-04-16 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440950, 782622, 94235, '<td valign="top">A little surprised this one''s not inverted based on the title. It does look like a space needle all the same. Well captured.</td>', 'A little surprised this one''s not inverted based on the title. It does look like a space needle all the same. Well captured.', '2009-04-16 20:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440951, 782473, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice <strike>tack</strike>, I mean take on the challenge. Love the color in the clouds.</td>', 'Nice tack, I mean take on the challenge. Love the color in the clouds.', '2009-04-16 20:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440952, 782639, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and a different take on the challenge.</td>', 'Good DOF and a different take on the challenge.', '2009-04-16 20:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440953, 782565, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a artistic success, it''s less than successful in a technnical sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than totally absorbing. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped, but the author''s intent is clear. Originally rated a 7, it has been upped to an 8 and well deserved. A little more thought would have brought the rating even higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a artistic success, it''s less than successful in a technnical sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than totally absorbing. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped, but the author''s intent is clear. Originally rated a 7, it has been upped to an 8 and well deserved. A little more thought would have brought the rating even higher.', '2009-04-16 20:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440955, 782615, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 20:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440956, 782531, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great macro. DOF, reflection and positioning are all excellent in this shot. Well done!</td>', 'Great macro. DOF, reflection and positioning are all excellent in this shot. Well done!', '2009-04-16 20:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440958, 782538, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, good DOF and I like the off center positioning. Good job!</td>', 'Nice arrangement, good DOF and I like the off center positioning. Good job!', '2009-04-16 20:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440960, 782501, 94235, '<td valign="top">Finally an entry with real tacks! Clever take. Well done.</td>', 'Finally an entry with real tacks! Clever take. Well done.', '2009-04-16 20:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440961, 782620, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well constructed and taken. Color appears a tad washed out to me but still a great shot all the same.</td>', 'Well constructed and taken. Color appears a tad washed out to me but still a great shot all the same.', '2009-04-16 20:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440962, 782616, 94235, '<td valign="top">Clever take and great clarity in this shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Clever take and great clarity in this shot. Nicely done.', '2009-04-16 20:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
