(5440965, 782664, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image is a less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'This image is a less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 21:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
