(5440979, 782619, 101256, '<td valign="top">First impression missed the humor entirely. The whimsey and humor are clear and very well executed. This reviewer is totally embarrased by missing this the first run through for rating and has bumped it from a seven to a 10. Well done. A ribbon winner for sure.</td>', 'First impression missed the humor entirely. The whimsey and humor are clear and very well executed. This reviewer is totally embarrased by missing this the first run through for rating and has bumped it from a seven to a 10. Well done. A ribbon winner for sure.', '2009-04-16 21:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
