(5440984, 782712, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant. The lighting is just a little overdone. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. Certainly less reflection in the image would have helped tremendously. A little more thought and better lighting would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant. The lighting is just a little overdone. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. Certainly less reflection in the image would have helped tremendously. A little more thought and better lighting would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 21:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440986, 782695, 99981, '<td valign="top">Hahahah! I don''t know why, but this shot made me really happy! Very funny, good idea!</td>', 'Hahahah! I don''t know why, but this shot made me really happy! Very funny, good idea!', '2009-04-16 21:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440987, 782714, 101256, '<td valign="top">A idea that this reviewer would have thought to see more of, this image is less than successful in both the artistic and technical sense. Frankly, the image is less than interesting due to the overwhelming setting.. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought, tighter focal length and better focus would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A idea that this reviewer would have thought to see more of, this image is less than successful in both the artistic and technical sense. Frankly, the image is less than interesting due to the overwhelming setting.. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought, tighter focal length and better focus would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 21:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440988, 782667, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. The lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. The lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 21:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440997, 782537, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes an image can be much too subtle do be truly effective - as it does in this case. At first, the impression was that the image was a true DNMC, but on comment review, the subject was finally found. From a technical standpoint, this is a purely technical success and in another setting would be a terrific image, but to meet this challenge, this reviewer feels that hunting for the title subject is a major flaw. Perhaps a more central focus on the subject matter (meaning that it would be less offset) would have been a much better approach.</td>', 'Sometimes an image can be much too subtle do be truly effective - as it does in this case. At first, the impression was that the image was a true DNMC, but on comment review, the subject was finally found. From a technical standpoint, this is a purely technical success and in another setting would be a terrific image, but to meet this challenge, this reviewer feels that hunting for the title subject is a major flaw. Perhaps a more central focus on the subject matter (meaning that it would be less offset) would have been a much better approach.', '2009-04-16 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440998, 782576, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'A clever idea and a technical success, it''s less than successful in an artistic sense. DOF control is excellant and the lighting isn''t over done creating blooms. The subject is less than interesting. Perhaps a slightly different angle would have helped. A little more thought and better framing would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 21:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440999, 782705, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot... composition good... exciting, too.</td>', 'Lovely shot... composition good... exciting, too.', '2009-04-16 21:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
