(5441018, 782596, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific image, but to this reviewer, the image seems to be much to subtle with respect to the challenge subject. However, it does contain tacks and the tacks, while underdone and understated, enhance the image but more in the respect of adding color and not necessarily detail as they get lost in the background. A technical success, but lacking that same success from an artistic standpoint. In a different challenge, it would be great.</td>', 'A terrific image, but to this reviewer, the image seems to be much to subtle with respect to the challenge subject. However, it does contain tacks and the tacks, while underdone and understated, enhance the image but more in the respect of adding color and not necessarily detail as they get lost in the background. A technical success, but lacking that same success from an artistic standpoint. In a different challenge, it would be great.', '2009-04-16 21:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
