(5441058, 782566, 101256, '<td valign="top">An artistic success, it''s less than successful in a technical sense. The lighting isn''t over done creating blooms, but it''s not a sharp as it should be - if the image was crisp, it would be an excellant entry. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped and/or a preset focus or longer focal length would have helped. A little more thought would have brought the rating higher.</td>', 'An artistic success, it''s less than successful in a technical sense. The lighting isn''t over done creating blooms, but it''s not a sharp as it should be - if the image was crisp, it would be an excellant entry. Perhaps a different background with a slightly different angle would have helped and/or a preset focus or longer focal length would have helped. A little more thought would have brought the rating higher.', '2009-04-16 21:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
