(5441076, 782710, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very clever concept and an artistic success. Unfortunately, from an technical standpoint, it doesn''t quite make the grade. A lot more sharper and crisp image would have helped this a lot. As it stands, it just misses being rated a 8 and possibly a nine. A little more thought while framing and focusing, perhaps even revisiting the image after processing would have been a better choice. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A very clever concept and an artistic success. Unfortunately, from an technical standpoint, it doesn''t quite make the grade. A lot more sharper and crisp image would have helped this a lot. As it stands, it just misses being rated a 8 and possibly a nine. A little more thought while framing and focusing, perhaps even revisiting the image after processing would have been a better choice. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-16 21:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
