(5441102, 782568, 101256, '<td valign="top">A second image derivative of another in this challenge and this reviewer cannot express enough how distasteful this twice viewed genre is personally. Having said that, it is technically perfect and from an artistic standpoint, effective with a lot of impact. While the image may be personally repugnant, it does deserve a change in rating from a six to a nine for it''s technical perfection.</td>', 'A second image derivative of another in this challenge and this reviewer cannot express enough how distasteful this twice viewed genre is personally. Having said that, it is technically perfect and from an artistic standpoint, effective with a lot of impact. While the image may be personally repugnant, it does deserve a change in rating from a six to a nine for it''s technical perfection.', '2009-04-16 22:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
