(5441246, 782648, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks a little too blurred and grainy. Can''t really tell if it is suspended or resting on the white band.</td>', 'Looks a little too blurred and grainy. Can''t really tell if it is suspended or resting on the white band.', '2009-04-16 23:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441247, 782478, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well taken. Good DOF and topped off nicely with the frame.</td>', 'Well taken. Good DOF and topped off nicely with the frame.', '2009-04-16 23:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441252, 782560, 94235, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell if this is in focus. Nice idea and composition all the same.</td>', 'Hard to tell if this is in focus. Nice idea and composition all the same.', '2009-04-16 23:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441254, 782476, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and the blue tones in the background top it off nicely.</td>', 'Great clarity and the blue tones in the background top it off nicely.', '2009-04-16 23:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441257, 782713, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and great use of lighting.</td>', 'Nice effect and great use of lighting.', '2009-04-16 23:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441261, 782559, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good for picking up oranges but girls may be another matter!  Good lighting, well framed and taken.</td>', 'Good for picking up oranges but girls may be another matter!  Good lighting, well framed and taken.', '2009-04-16 23:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441262, 782686, 88580, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I have a woody, but I don''t care too much for pictures of him.  That said, you did a fantastic job of creating motion in this shot.  It is very dynamic.  The tacks really feel as if they are being shot from some sort of tack shooter, and Woody looks to be in pain...falling to the ground from his tack-ssasination.</td>', 'Yeah, I have a woody, but I don''t care too much for pictures of him.  That said, you did a fantastic job of creating motion in this shot.  It is very dynamic.  The tacks really feel as if they are being shot from some sort of tack shooter, and Woody looks to be in pain...falling to the ground from his tack-ssasination.', '2009-04-16 23:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441263, 782659, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Great lighting and color. One of my favs so far.</td>', 'Well composed. Great lighting and color. One of my favs so far.', '2009-04-16 23:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441265, 782719, 88580, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55838" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aimeethetoo</a> wannabe or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55838" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aimeethetoo</a> herself?</td>', ' aimeethetoo wannabe or  aimeethetoo herself?', '2009-04-16 23:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441266, 782692, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good stock photo. Nice colors and well framed.</td>', 'Looks like a good stock photo. Nice colors and well framed.', '2009-04-16 23:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441267, 782657, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. The dark lighting works well and suits the title aptly.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. The dark lighting works well and suits the title aptly.', '2009-04-16 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441268, 782597, 88580, '<td valign="top">Your picture conveys the story even without the title.  Very well done.</td>', 'Your picture conveys the story even without the title.  Very well done.', '2009-04-16 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441270, 782628, 94235, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect and pleasing to see a different type of tack. Well composed.</td>', 'Interesting effect and pleasing to see a different type of tack. Well composed.', '2009-04-16 23:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441271, 782540, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great arrangement and a classic title to boot! Well done on a nice capture.</td>', 'Great arrangement and a classic title to boot! Well done on a nice capture.', '2009-04-16 23:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441272, 782664, 88580, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  You''ll probably get dinged for not having the point in perfect focus, but who cares.  I love the simplicity and the smoothness.</td>', 'This is awesome.  You''ll probably get dinged for not having the point in perfect focus, but who cares.  I love the simplicity and the smoothness.', '2009-04-16 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441274, 782710, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. Well set out and nice cropping.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. Well set out and nice cropping.', '2009-04-16 23:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441275, 782568, 88580, '<td valign="top">Some of you people are too obsessed/determined/committed.  Really :)</td>', 'Some of you people are too obsessed/determined/committed.  Really :)', '2009-04-16 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441276, 782567, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the left side. Would have liked to see a greater DOF for more clarity but still a good shot all the same.</td>', 'Nice detail on the left side. Would have liked to see a greater DOF for more clarity but still a good shot all the same.', '2009-04-16 23:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441278, 782592, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and especially love the background effect with the tea.</td>', 'Nice colors and especially love the background effect with the tea.', '2009-04-16 23:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441279, 782671, 88580, '<td valign="top">Hasn''t there already been enough hubbub about this image?  You did a great job recreating it with tacks.</td>', 'Hasn''t there already been enough hubbub about this image?  You did a great job recreating it with tacks.', '2009-04-16 23:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441280, 782601, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well done. It would make a good health stock photo.</td>', 'Well done. It would make a good health stock photo.', '2009-04-16 23:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441281, 782599, 88580, '<td valign="top">I dig the gritty, contrasty look of this one.</td>', 'I dig the gritty, contrasty look of this one.', '2009-04-16 23:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441285, 782659, 88580, '<td valign="top">A strange tale you''re telling here.  Quite original.</td>', 'A strange tale you''re telling here.  Quite original.', '2009-04-16 23:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
