(5449098, 782684, 20577, '<td valign="top">Wow! You must be a woman photographer because no man would ever come up with such a fancy idea for a picture... if you know what I mean... wink wink...<br/> <br/>Oh yeah... you must also be a really bad bowler. I want my pin tomorrow!</td>', 'Wow! You must be a woman photographer because no man would ever come up with such a fancy idea for a picture... if you know what I mean... wink wink... Oh yeah... you must also be a really bad bowler. I want my pin tomorrow!', '2009-04-22 19:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449306, 782705, 89223, '<td valign="top">very nice photo! i feel the tilt makes this photo a bit more intristing to look at then if it was straight on. The lighting well placed and the slashed blue (bottom right corner) is well placed. i really like this photo and feel its in the top of this challenge if not a winner! good luck great job!</td>', 'very nice photo! i feel the tilt makes this photo a bit more intristing to look at then if it was straight on. The lighting well placed and the slashed blue (bottom right corner) is well placed. i really like this photo and feel its in the top of this challenge if not a winner! good luck great job!', '2009-04-22 21:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5449321, 782543, 89223, '<td valign="top">i love looking at this photo and oddly enough it kinda makes me hungry for an apple lol, anyway the lighting is very nice i think possibaly elimanating or softening the shadow on the bottom left of the apple would have helped make the apple stand out a bit more in this. maybe the use of a reflector would have helped. either way very nice. i think for me i would have liked to see more of the basket on the left side, being a bit more direct with the rule of thirds and putting the title a bit more out there. very nice work!</td>', 'i love looking at this photo and oddly enough it kinda makes me hungry for an apple lol, anyway the lighting is very nice i think possibaly elimanating or softening the shadow on the bottom left of the apple would have helped make the apple stand out a bit more in this. maybe the use of a reflector would have helped. either way very nice. i think for me i would have liked to see more of the basket on the left side, being a bit more direct with the rule of thirds and putting the title a bit more out there. very nice work!', '2009-04-22 21:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
