(5449766, 782647, 93565, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s the red color of the tack and the other white ones, but all this one makes me think of is the old Apple 1984 commercial...</td>', 'I guess it''s the red color of the tack and the other white ones, but all this one makes me think of is the old Apple 1984 commercial...', '2009-04-23 08:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5449772, 782648, 101492, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback everyone.  I need to learn how to control the technical aspects of my camera.  I always seem to ruin my photo when I have to resize it to meet the entry requirements of the site.  This pic was crisp in the original, but way too big.  I had the same problem with another one of my entries.  Then, when I resize, they become grainy and distorted.  I did try something very different here from my usual.  It didn''t pay off for me score-wise, but that is what it takes to learn.  Plus, as delin so kindly pointed out to me, at least I have a ribbon now! lol, thanks, Dave!!!</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback everyone.  I need to learn how to control the technical aspects of my camera.  I always seem to ruin my photo when I have to resize it to meet the entry requirements of the site.  This pic was crisp in the original, but way too big.  I had the same problem with another one of my entries.  Then, when I resize, they become grainy and distorted.  I did try something very different here from my usual.  It didn''t pay off for me score-wise, but that is what it takes to learn.  Plus, as delin so kindly pointed out to me, at least I have a ribbon now! lol, thanks, Dave!!!', '2009-04-23 08:34:40.000000', NULL, 0),
