(5450555, 782691, 12250, '<td valign="top">Yes it is.  I can''t wait for the same thing to happen by exceeding expectations and to place in the top 10 or even win a ribbon.  I''ll keep trying.  Thanks for the comment.<br/> <br/>Nice portfolio...great images and ribbons.  Good luck on your future 10th ribbon!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Isn''t it great when an entry does so much better than expected.   I think this is great!   I''m glad it way exceeded your expectations :) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Yes it is.  I can''t wait for the same thing to happen by exceeding expectations and to place in the top 10 or even win a ribbon.  I''ll keep trying.  Thanks for the comment. Nice portfolio...great images and ribbons.  Good luck on your future 10th ribbon! Originally posted by SandyP: Isn''t it great when an entry does so much better than expected.   I think this is great!   I''m glad it way exceeded your expectations :) ', '2009-04-24 01:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5450670, 782541, 28742, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_784795.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_784795.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_784795.gif"/> <br/>Crap! Wore out another one! ;-) You''re incredibly amazing, Irene! Now I''m off to buy another dozen rubber stamps. :)</td>', ' Crap! Wore out another one! ;-) You''re incredibly amazing, Irene! Now I''m off to buy another dozen rubber stamps. :)', '2009-04-24 04:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
